ZCOOL XiaoWei / 站酷小薇, Ma Shan Zheng / 马善政楷书, ZCOOL KuaiLe / 站酷快乐体, Long Cang / 龙藏体,
Noto Serif SC / Noto Sans SC (Chinese typefaces, loaded from fonts.googleapis.cn only when chosen, not bundled)
  SIL Open Font License 1.1

Poem data — snowtraces/poetry-source and 诗泉 palemoky/chinese-poetry-api
  Poems are fetched at runtime from the public HTTP APIs at
  https://poetry-api.snowtraces.com (https://github.com/snowtraces/poetry-source) and
  https://poetry.palemoky.com (https://github.com/palemoky/chinese-poetry-api).
  No code from those projects is included in this repository.

Natural Earth (rivers and lakes on the poets' footprint map)
  site/data/rivers.json is simplified by tools/build-map.py from Natural Earth 1:10m
  rivers_lake_centerlines and lakes. Made with Natural Earth — public domain.
  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

Classical poem texts in site/poem/daily-poems.json are public-domain works.
